    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney’s are delighted to present “Inisfree”, South Circular Road, Limerick to the market. This substantial detached period residence, dating from 1925, extends to approximately 140.26 sq. m. (1,509 sq. ft.) and occupies a generous 0.19-acre private site with mature front and rear gardens.\r\nIdeally positioned on the ever-popular and highly sought-after South Circular Road, this charming two-storey home is full of character and retains many original period features, including ornate cornicing, decorative architraves, and original fireplaces, all of which contribute to its timeless appeal.\r\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises two spacious reception rooms, a kitchen / dining room, utility room and bathroom at ground floor level. Upstairs, there are five bedrooms together with a separate WC, providing ample accommodation for family living.\r\nExternally, the property enjoys mature and private gardens to both the front and rear. A gated pedestrian entrance and gravel pathway lead to the house, while a shared side passage provides vehicular access to the rear. Additional features include a garage, storage sheds and a large private rear garden offering excellent potential for further extension or landscaping.\r\nThe location is second to none, within walking distance of Mary Immaculate College, a range of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, Crescent Shopping Centre, Limerick City Centre, together with an excellent selection of restaurants, sporting facilities and leisure amenities.\r\n\r\n“Inisfree” offers spacious and versatile accommodation extending to five bedrooms, making it an ideal home for growing families, those seeking flexible living arrangements, or purchasers requiring dedicated home office space. \r\n\r\nComplemented by bright reception rooms, generous living accommodation and a large private site, the property combines period charm with excellent potential for modernisation coupled  with the benefit of full planning permission being in place for further extension and enhancement.\r\n\r\n“Inisfree” represents a rare opportunity to acquire a detached period home of immense charm and character on one of Limerick’s most prestigious residential addresses. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 6.54m x 2.05m\r\n Welcoming entrance hall with attractive parquet wood flooring.\r\nReception Room 1: 5.44m x 3.31m\r\n Large, bright reception room featuring a bay window overlooking the front garden, carpet flooring, and an original period fireplace with fitted gas fire.\r\nReception Room 2: 5.64m x 3.31m\r\n Spacious second reception room overlooking the front garden, carpeted, with period fireplace and fitted gas fire.\r\nKitchen / Dining Room: 5.61m x 3.45m\r\n Well-proportioned kitchen/dining area with fitted kitchen units, tiled flooring, and a traditional Wellstood twin oven solid fuel cooker.\r\nUtility Room: 2.64m x 1.98m\r\n Practical utility space with gas central heating boiler, fitted storage units, and tiled flooring.\r\nBathroom: 2.46m x 2.31m\r\n Comprising WC, WHB unit, bath and separate shower, with tiled shower area and partially tiled walls.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nUpstairs WC: 1.66m x 0.83m\r\n With WC and carpet flooring.\r\nBedroom 1: 4.08m x 3.01m\r\n Large, bright double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and wash hand basin unit, overlooking both front and rear gardens.\r\nBedroom 2: 2.59m x 1.84m\r\n Bright single bedroom, ideal as a child’s room or work-from-home office, overlooking the rear garden\r\n Bedroom 3: 4.52m x 3.50m\r\n Bright and spacious double bedroom, carpeted, with built-in wardrobes and wash hand basin unit, overlooking the rear garden.\r\nBedroom 4: 2.84m x 2.76m\r\n Bright single bedroom, carpeted, with built-in wardrobes and wash hand basin unit, overlooking the side passageway.\r\nBedroom 5: 3.96m x 3.52m\r\n Generous double bedroom, carpeted, with built-in wardrobes and wash hand basin unit, overlooking the front garden"
      },
